        content: "\n## \u6D4F\u89C8\u5668\u63D2\u4EF6\u7C7B\u578B\n\n\u901A\u8FC7\u6D4F\u89C8\u5668\u63D2\u4EF6\u53EF\u4EE5\u5B9E\u73B0\u4E00\u4E9B\u81EA\u5B9A\u4E49\u529F\u80FD\uFF0C\u6BD4\u5982\uFF1A\u81EA\u5B9A\u4E49\u80CC\u666F\u3001\u5B57\u4F53\u3001\u6D4F\u89C8\u6A21\u5F0F\u7B49\u3002\n\n\u5728\u6240\u6709\u6D4F\u89C8\u5668\u4E2D\uFF0Cchrome \u662F\u6700\u5177\u6269\u5C55\u6027\uFF0Cfirefox\u3001edge \u7B49\u4E5F\u4E0D\u9519\u3002\u800C\u4E14\u6709\u4E9B\u63D2\u4EF6\u901A\u7528\u517C\u5BB9 firefox \u548C edge\u3002\n\n\u4E3B\u9898\u63D2\u4EF6\uFF1A[\u3010All Chrome Themes\u3011](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/category/themes?hl=en-GB)\n\n\u65B0\u7A97\u53E3\u63D2\u4EF6\uFF1A\u6BD4\u5982[daily.dev](https://daily.dev/) [\u3010Some new tab extension on chrome\u3011](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/category/collection/customize_your_new_tab_page)\n\n\u5F39\u7A97\u63D2\u4EF6\uFF1A\n\n- [Lighthouse](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/lighthouse/blipmdconlkpinefehnmjammfjpmpbjk)\n- [Developer toolbar](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/web-developer/bfbameneiokkgbdmiekhjnmfkcnldhhm)\n- [Metamask](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/metamask/nkbihfbeogaeaoehlefnkodbefgpgknn)\n\n\u4EE5\u4E0B\u662F Lighthouse \u5F39\u7A97\u63D2\u4EF6\u754C\u9762\n![rxfcjO](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/manonicu/pics@master/uPic/rxfcjO.jpg)\n\n\u9875\u9762\u6CE8\u5165\u63D2\u4EF6\n\n- [Redux devtools](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/redux-devtools/lmhkpmbekcpmknklioeibfkpmmfibljd)\n- [Black magic](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/blackmagicso-extension/efnjehgfpbogpclnkikafpbgbahaflfd)\n- [JSON viewer](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/json-viewer/gbmdgpbipfallnflgajpaliibnhdgobh)\n\n\u5F00\u53D1\u8005\u5DE5\u5177\u63D2\u4EF6\n\n\u8FD9\u53EF\u80FD\u662F\u5F00\u53D1\u8005\u63A5\u89E6\u7684\u6BD4\u8F83\u591A\u7684\u63D2\u4EF6\uFF0C\u6BD4\u5982\uFF1A\n\n- [React devtools](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/react-developer-tools/fmkadmapgofadopljbjfkapdkoienihi)\n- [Polymer devtools](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/polymer-devtools-extensio/mmpfaamodhhlbadloaibpocmcomledcg)\n- [Ember inspector](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/ember-inspector/bmdblncegkenkacieihfhpjfppoconhi)\n",
