        data: {
          type: "Post",
          date: "2022-05-19",
          title: "Next.js - Imperative Routing",
          tags: [
            "nodejs",
            "javascript",
            "Nextjs"
          ],
          description: "\u547D\u4EE4\u5F0F\u8DEF\u7531",
          cover: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/manonicu/pics@master/uPic/Next.js_bg.svg"
        },
        content: "\n\u5230\u76EE\u524D\u4E3A\u6B62\uFF0C\u4F7F\u7528 `Link` \u7EC4\u4EF6\u4ECE\u4E00\u4E2A\u9875\u9762\u5BFC\u822A\u5230\u53E6\u4E00\u4E2A\u9875\u9762\u3002\u4F7F\u7528 `Router` \u7EC4\u4EF6\u4E5F\u53EF\u4EE5\u5B9E\u73B0\u76F8\u540C\u7684\u529F\u80FD\u3002\n\n\u66F4\u65B0`index.js`\n\n```jsx\nimport Router from 'next/router'\nimport Head from 'next/head'\n\nfunction HomePage(props) {\n  return (\n    <>\n      <Head>\n        <title>Welcome to Next.js!</title>\n      </Head>\n      <div>Welcome to Next.js!</div>\n      <span onClick={() => Router.push('/posts/one')}>First Post</span>\n      <br />\n      <div>Next stars: {props.stars}</div>\n      <img src=\"/logo.png\" alt=\"Logo\" />\n    </>\n  )\n}\n\nexport async function getServerSideProps(context) {\n  const res = await fetch('https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js')\n  const json = await res.json()\n  return {\n    props: {stars: json.stargazers_count}\n  }\n}\n\nexport default HomePage\n```\n\n\u542F\u52A8\u670D\u52A1\n\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n```\n\n\u9A8C\u8BC1\u7ED3\u679C\n\n![iZhXRv](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/manonicu/pics@master/uPic/iZhXRv.png)\n",
        slug: "/Users/pfan/Workspace/github/site/app/content/javascript/nextjs/11-Imperitive Routing",
        isEmpty: false,
