        data: {
          type: "Post",
          date: "2021-04-15",
          title: "React Fragments",
          tags: [
            "react",
            "javascript"
          ],
          description: "React\u662F\u4E00\u4E2AJavaScript\u5E93\uFF0C\u81F4\u529B\u4E8E\u4F7FUI\u5F00\u53D1\u53D8\u5F97\u7B80\u5355"
        },
        content: "\n`React` \u8FD8\u4E3A\u6211\u4EEC\u63D0\u4F9B\u4E86\u4E00\u79CD\u79F0\u4E3A`fragment`\u7684\u5143\u7D20\u3002\n\n`React` \u8981\u6C42\u5728\u5355\u4E2A\u201C\u7236\u201D\u7EC4\u4EF6\u4E2D\u8FD4\u56DE\u6240\u6709\u8FD4\u56DE\u7684\u5143\u7D20\u3002\n\n\u4F8B\u5982\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u4E0D\u80FD\u8FD4\u56DE\u4E24\u4E2A\u540C\u7EA7\u5143\u7D20\uFF0C\u6BD4\u5982 `h1` \u548C\u7EC4\u4EF6\u4E2D\u7684\u6BB5\u843D\uFF1A\n\n```jsx\n// this syntax is invalid\n// function MyComponent() {\n//   return (\n//     <h1>My header</h1>\n//     <p>My paragraph</p>\n//   );\n// }\n```\n\n```jsx\n// valid syntax\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  return (\n    <>\n      <h1>My header</h1>\n      <p>My paragraph</p>\n    </>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n\u4F7F\u7528`<React.Fragment></React.Fragment>` or `<></>`\u53EF\u8FD4\u56DE\u591A\u4E2A\u5143\u7D20\u3002\n",
        slug: "/Users/pfan/Workspace/github/site/app/content/javascript/react/React Fragments",
        isEmpty: false,
        excerpt: ""
